  "duration": 44.849998474121094,
  "text": "Every wedding venue wants more enquiries. But that's not where most bookings are won or lost. They're won in the moments after a couple gets in touch. 81% of couples say they felt frustrated by venue responses. Two-thirds visit three venues or fewer before making a decision. And 68% of wedding enquiries happen outside office hours. Yet according to our own venue health check research, only 14% of venues respond within the first hour. That's the gap. The gap between enquiry and response. Between interest and action. Between a potential booking and a lost opportunity. VenueBot was built to close that gap.",
